{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:260","content":{"id":260,"title":"42 如何强化免疫系统","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e453c6e2-0af3-440d-8256-52a53e2d4983","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强化免疫系统不是好主意，都是骗你买没用东西想出来的："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"54ae4f7e-9629-4a0b-a984-7779c4682456","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ebf8aef8-8861-47d6-a7ec-fa3efd0cc8f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c1dd146-c8d6-415c-9ebd-58167f45fa34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强化巨噬细胞和中性粒细胞 -> 导致更多、更严重的发炎、发热、不适和乏力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d5e5ff50-26c2-492e-babd-1822cbdcf36b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a819ed7e-c298-429a-9f08-0c32dbed506c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强化自然杀伤性细胞 -> 导致  NK 细胞太过激进，损失健康细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"41644d62-1ffc-4a6d-ac08-ff676e542950","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f93ab705-faf0-4da6-ae2f-d054f3e8fbf3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强化树突细胞 -> 频繁激活适应性免疫系统，大大消耗免疫系统，真碰到感染时没有丝毫保护能力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"16ee671a-b378-4c7d-b6d5-cefc8b352c26","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7ff7687d-878a-4072-be58-b2573c50d54f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强化肥大细胞和 B 细胞 -> 过敏的罪魁祸首，本来只是肠道不适，现在则会引起严重腹泻甚至过敏性休克，几分钟让人丧命"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7e150ee-a669-4096-80ed-84ef79b911d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过也不太可能真的强化免疫系统，能买到的合法产品都做不到。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61dbaae0-e541-4b25-9f0d-c09f504bdf14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"免疫系统应该是平衡的，稳定的，在恰好的时候发挥作用。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"e2e61901-6d39-4625-bc73-9fea689c28a9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6a0168a-576e-4477-aa80-cc66dcdde0b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过我觉得适应性免疫系统发生作用有点晚，要好多天，能不能快点。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1d4da34-8053-4d85-a6c3-adf9f47575b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要拥有健康的免疫系统，最需要做的是平衡膳食，摄入任务需要的各种维生素和营养。营养不良和免疫系统功能低下有很强的关联性，饥饿的人更容易感染生病。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f165ff17-4fd6-4918-8fbd-a028e54a378c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"锻炼可以直接强化免疫系统，可以促进体液全身循环，细胞和免疫蛋白可以更快自由地流动。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"42 如何强化免疫系统","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:260","type":"doc","id":260}}],"prevPage":{"title":"41 卫生假说和老朋友","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:259","type":"doc","id":259}},"nextPage":{"title":"43 免疫系统与应激","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:261","type":"doc","id":261}},"createTime":1741915364689,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}